    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditTakeLines
        Params: lines, pos, n
        Returns: sub

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Taken lines accumulate here
            Op: Core.List
            Returns: sub

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Take cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: k

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while lines remain to take
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: k, n
            Returns: kcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Copy one line per step
            Condition: kcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Absolute index into the stream
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: pos, k
                    Returns: idx

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the stream line
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: lines, idx
                    Returns: ln

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Keep the line
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: sub, ln
                    Returns: sub

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the take cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: k, 1
                    Returns: k

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: k, n
                    Returns: kcont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Taken line slice
            State: Ok
            Returns: sub

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditJoinLines
        Params: lines, nl
        Returns: text

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Terminated lines accumulate here
            Op: Core.List
            Returns: parts

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: lines
            Returns: llen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while lines remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, llen
            Returns: icont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Terminate each line once
            Condition: icont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current line
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: lines, i
                    Returns: ln

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Single line with its newline
                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                    Params: ln, nl
                    Returns: term

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Keep the terminated line
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: parts, term
                    Returns: parts

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the line cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, llen
                    Returns: icont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Single-pass join of terminated lines
            Op: Core.StrJoinParts
            Params: parts
            Returns: text

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Joined text with newlines
            State: Ok
            Returns: text

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditFrame
        Params: stream
        Returns: f

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line separator for the frame
            Op: Core.Chr
            Params: 10
            Returns: nl

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Split the stream into lines
            Op: Core.StrSplit
            Params: stream, nl
            Returns: lines

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Base directory for storage reads
            Op: Core.ListGet
            Params: lines, 0
            Returns: base

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Structural path or entry slot
            Op: Core.ListGet
            Params: lines, 1
            Returns: path

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Target line count as text
            Op: Core.ListGet
            Params: lines, 2
            Returns: nstr

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Target line count as number
            Op: Core.StrParse
            Params: nstr
            Returns: n

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Target starts past the three header lines
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 3
            Returns: three

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Take exactly the target lines
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditTakeLines, lines, three, n
            Returns: tlines

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Join the target lines back to text
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditJoinLines, tlines, nl
            Returns: target

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Payload starts past target
            Op: Core.Add
            Params: three, n
            Returns: ppos

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Stream length bounds the payload
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: lines
            Returns: total

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Payload line count is the remainder
            Op: Core.Sub
            Params: total, ppos
            Returns: prem

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Take the payload lines
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditTakeLines, lines, ppos, prem
            Returns: plines

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Join the payload lines back to text
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditJoinLines, plines, nl
            Returns: payload

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Frame map carries the sections
            Op: Core.Map
            Returns: f

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Keep the base directory
            Op: Core.MapSetMut
            Params: f, "base", base
            Returns: f

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Keep the structural path
            Op: Core.MapSetMut
            Params: f, "path", path
            Returns: f

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Keep the target text
            Op: Core.MapSetMut
            Params: f, "target", target
            Returns: f

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Keep the payload text
            Op: Core.MapSetMut
            Params: f, "payload", payload
            Returns: f

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Parsed frame map
            State: Ok
            Returns: f

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditDirHead
        Params: rel
        Returns: dir

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: No slash seen yet
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: -1
            Returns: last

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Slash separator literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: "/"
            Returns: slash

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Scan starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: start

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: First slash position or minus one
            Op: Core.StrFind
            Params: rel, slash, start
            Returns: pos

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Position is valid while non-negative
            Op: Core.Ge
            Params: pos, start
            Returns: pcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Remember each slash, seek the next
            Condition: pcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: This slash is the last so far
                    Op: Core.Id
                    Params: pos
                    Returns: last

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: One step literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: 1
                    Returns: one

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Seek past this slash
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: pos, one
                    Returns: start

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Next slash position or minus one
                    Op: Core.StrFind
                    Params: rel, slash, start
                    Returns: pos

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Keep scanning while slash found
                    Op: Core.Ge
                    Params: pos, start
                    Returns: pcont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Zero literal for the slash test
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: zero

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Slash seen while scanning
            Op: Core.Ge
            Params: last, zero
            Returns: hasSlash

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Cut the head or stay empty
            Condition: hasSlash

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Head is everything before the last slash
                    Op: Core.StrSub
                    Params: rel, 0, last
                    Returns: dir

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Empty via zero-width slice, no bare empty literal
                    Op: Core.StrSub
                    Params: rel, zero, zero
                    Returns: dir

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Directory head or empty
            State: Ok
            Returns: dir

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditNormalize
        Params: path
        Returns: norm

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Line separator doubles as split token holder
            Op: Core.Chr
            Params: 10
            Returns: nl

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Slash separator literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: "/"
            Returns: slash

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Split the path into segments
            Op: Core.StrSplit
            Params: path, slash
            Returns: segs

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Kept segments accumulate here
            Op: Core.List
            Returns: kept

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Kept count is the stack pointer
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: slen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Segment count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: segs
            Returns: glen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Segment cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: gi

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while segments remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: gi, glen
            Returns: gcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Resolve dots against the stack pointer
            Condition: gcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current segment
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: segs, gi
                    Returns: seg

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Empty segment is a no-op
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: seg, ""
                    Returns: isEmpty

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Dot segment is a no-op
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: seg, "."
                    Returns: isDot

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: DotDot pops one level
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: seg, ".."
                    Returns: isDotDot

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Skip empties and dots
                    Op: Core.Or
                    Params: isEmpty, isDot
                    Returns: skip

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Skip, pop, or push
                    Condition: skip

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Stack pointer unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: slen
                            Returns: slen

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Kept list unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: kept
                            Returns: kept

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Branch
                            Type: Branch
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Pop or push the segment
                            Condition: isDotDot

                            TrueBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: One level literal
                                    Op: Core.Lit
                                    Params: 1
                                    Returns: one

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Pop the stack pointer
                                    Op: Core.Sub
                                    Params: slen, one
                                    Returns: slen

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Zero literal for the live prefix
                                    Op: Core.Lit
                                    Params: 0
                                    Returns: zero

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Cut the popped tail at once or pushes misalign
                                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                                    Params: EditTakeLines, kept, zero, slen
                                    Returns: kept

                            FalseBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Push the segment
                                    Op: Core.ListPush
                                    Params: kept, seg
                                    Returns: kept

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: One level literal
                                    Op: Core.Lit
                                    Params: 1
                                    Returns: one

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Grow the stack pointer
                                    Op: Core.Add
                                    Params: slen, one
                                    Returns: slen

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the segment cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: gi, 1
                    Returns: gi

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: gi, glen
                    Returns: gcont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Keep the live prefix of the stack
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditTakeLines, kept, 0, slen
            Returns: live

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Live count bounds the join
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: live
            Returns: llen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Joined segments accumulate here
            Op: Core.List
            Returns: parts

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Join cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: ji

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while segments remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: ji, llen
            Returns: jcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Interleave slashes between segments
            Condition: jcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: First segment needs no separator
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: ji, 0
                    Returns: isFirst

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Separator only past the first
                    Condition: isFirst

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Parts unchanged for the first
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: parts
                            Returns: parts

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Keep the separator
                            Op: Core.ListPush
                            Params: parts, slash
                            Returns: parts

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current segment
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: live, ji
                    Returns: seg

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Keep the segment
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: parts, seg
                    Returns: parts

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the join cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: ji, 1
                    Returns: ji

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: ji, llen
                    Returns: jcont

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Single-pass join of the normalized path
            Op: Core.StrJoinParts
            Params: parts
            Returns: norm

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Normalized path without dots
            State: Ok
            Returns: norm

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditReadText
        Params: base, full
        Returns: text

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Empty base means preopen root
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: base, ""
            Returns: bareBase

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Join base or read bare
            Condition: bareBase

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Bare relative path
                    Op: Core.Id
                    Params: full
                    Returns: p

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Slash separator literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: "/"
                    Returns: slash

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Base plus relative path
                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                    Params: base, slash, full
                    Returns: p

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Read the file loudly or fail loudly
            Op: Sys.Storage.Read
            Params: p
            Returns: text

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: File text
            State: Ok
            Returns: text

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditHasStr
        Params: lst, s
        Returns: found

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Absent until proven present
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: false
            Returns: found

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Candidate count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: lst
            Returns: llen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Candidate cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while candidates remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, llen
            Returns: icont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Compare each candidate once
            Condition: icont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current candidate
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: lst, i
                    Returns: cand

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Match against the needle
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: cand, s
                    Returns: hit

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Accumulate the match flag
                    Op: Core.Or
                    Params: found, hit
                    Returns: found

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the candidate cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, llen
                    Returns: icont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Membership verdict
            State: Ok
            Returns: found

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditCapsAdd
        Params: caps, csv
        Returns: caps

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Comma code point, quotes cannot carry commas
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 44
            Returns: commaCode

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Comma separator from its code point
            Op: Core.Chr
            Params: commaCode
            Returns: comma

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Missing csv means no capabilities
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: csv, null
            Returns: noCsv

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Split or keep empty items
            Condition: noCsv

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Empty items for missing csv
                    Op: Core.List
                    Returns: items

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Split the capability list
                    Op: Core.StrSplit
                    Params: csv, comma
                    Returns: items

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Item count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: items
            Returns: ilen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Item cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: i

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while items remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: i, ilen
            Returns: icont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Union one capability per step
            Condition: icont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current item
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: items, i
                    Returns: item

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Whitespace is not a capability
                    Op: Core.StrTrim
                    Params: item
                    Returns: cap

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Capability length decides empty or not
                    Op: Core.StrLen
                    Params: cap
                    Returns: caplen

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Zero length literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: 0
                    Returns: zero

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Skip empties loudly never
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: caplen, zero
                    Returns: isEmpty

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Already known capability
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EditHasStr, caps, cap
                    Returns: known

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Skip empties or known names
                    Op: Core.Or
                    Params: isEmpty, known
                    Returns: skip

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Union or pass through
                    Condition: skip

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Capability set unchanged
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: caps
                            Returns: caps

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Union the new capability
                            Op: Core.ListPush
                            Params: caps, cap
                            Returns: caps

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the item cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: i, 1
                    Returns: i

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: i, ilen
                    Returns: icont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Capability union
            State: Ok
            Returns: caps

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditFuncName
        Params: fnode
        Returns: nm

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Property map of the function node
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: fnode, "props"
            Returns: props

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Declared function name
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: props, "Name"
            Returns: name

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Name length decides fallback or not
            Op: Core.StrLen
            Params: name
            Returns: namelen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Zero length literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: zero

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Fall back to Caption when unnamed
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: namelen, zero
            Returns: nameless

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Name or Caption
            Condition: nameless

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Caption fallback mirrors the host expander
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: props, "Caption"
                    Returns: nm

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Declared name wins
                    Op: Core.Id
                    Params: name
                    Returns: nm

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Function identity
            State: Ok
            Returns: nm

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditAddFuncs
        Params: estate, kids
        Returns: estate

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Child count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: kids
            Returns: klen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Child cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: ki

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while children remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: ki, klen
            Returns: kcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Adopt each new function once
            Condition: kcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current child
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: kids, ki
                    Returns: ch

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Child block name selects functions
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: ch, "name"
                    Returns: cn

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Function block literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: "Function"
                    Returns: fnLit

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Adopt only function blocks
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: cn, fnLit
                    Returns: isFunc

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Adopt or pass through
                    Condition: isFunc

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Identity of the candidate
                            Op: Ctrl.Call
                            Params: EditFuncName, ch
                            Returns: nm

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Adopted names live in the estate
                            Op: Core.MapGet
                            Params: estate, "names"
                            Returns: names

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Already adopted function
                            Op: Ctrl.Call
                            Params: EditHasStr, names, nm
                            Returns: known

                        Branch
                            Type: Branch
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Adopt or keep the estate
                            Condition: known

                            TrueBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Estate unchanged on duplicate
                                    Op: Core.Id
                                    Params: estate
                                    Returns: estate

                            FalseBlock
                                Type: Section
                                Role: Content

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Adopted functions live in the estate
                                    Op: Core.MapGet
                                    Params: estate, "funcs"
                                    Returns: funcs

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Keep the function body
                                    Op: Core.ListPush
                                    Params: funcs, ch
                                    Returns: funcs

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Keep the function name
                                    Op: Core.ListPush
                                    Params: names, nm
                                    Returns: names

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Store the functions back
                                    Op: Core.MapSetMut
                                    Params: estate, "funcs", funcs
                                    Returns: estate

                                Instruction
                                    Type: Instruction
                                    Role: Content
                                    Caption: Store the names back
                                    Op: Core.MapSetMut
                                    Params: estate, "names", names
                                    Returns: estate

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Estate unchanged past functions
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: estate
                            Returns: estate

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the child cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: ki, 1
                    Returns: ki

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: ki, klen
                    Returns: kcont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Estate with adopted functions
            State: Ok
            Returns: estate

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditFindModule
        Params: ast
        Returns: mod

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Empty module default fails loudly downstream
            Op: Core.Map
            Returns: mod

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Top-level blocks of the document
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: ast, "children"
            Returns: children

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Block count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: children
            Returns: clen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Block cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: ci

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while blocks remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: ci, clen
            Returns: ccont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: First Module block wins
            Condition: ccont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current block
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: children, ci
                    Returns: ch

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Block name selects the module
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: ch, "name"
                    Returns: cn

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Module block literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: "Module"
                    Returns: modLit

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Module block found
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: cn, modLit
                    Returns: isMod

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Keep or pass through
                    Condition: isMod

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Keep the module block
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: ch
                            Returns: mod

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Stop past the module
                            Op: Core.Add
                            Params: ci, clen
                            Returns: ci

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Module unchanged past other blocks
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: mod
                            Returns: mod

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Advance the block cursor
                            Op: Core.Add
                            Params: ci, 1
                            Returns: ci

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: ci, clen
                    Returns: ccont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Module block of the document
            State: Ok
            Returns: mod

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditVisit
        Params: mod, dir, base, estate
        Returns: estate

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Module children carry the includes
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: mod, "children"
            Returns: kids

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Child count bounds the scan
            Op: Core.ListLen
            Params: kids
            Returns: klen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Child cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: ki

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while children remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: ki, klen
            Returns: kcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Visit each include once
            Condition: kcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current child
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: kids, ki
                    Returns: ch

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Child block name selects includes
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: ch, "name"
                    Returns: cn

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Include block literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: "Include"
                    Returns: incLit

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Visit only include blocks
                    Op: Core.Eq
                    Params: cn, incLit
                    Returns: isInc

                Branch
                    Type: Branch
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Visit or pass through
                    Condition: isInc

                    TrueBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Property map of the include
                            Op: Core.MapGet
                            Params: ch, "props"
                            Returns: props

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Relative path of the include
                            Op: Core.MapGet
                            Params: props, "Path"
                            Returns: rel

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Visit the included file
                            Op: Ctrl.Call
                            Params: EditVisitFile, dir, rel, base, estate
                            Returns: estate

                    FalseBlock
                        Type: Section
                        Role: Content

                        Instruction
                            Type: Instruction
                            Role: Content
                            Caption: Estate unchanged past includes
                            Op: Core.Id
                            Params: estate
                            Returns: estate

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Advance the child cursor
                    Op: Core.Add
                    Params: ki, 1
                    Returns: ki

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Re-evaluate the bound
                    Op: Core.Lt
                    Params: ki, klen
                    Returns: kcont

        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            Caption: Estate with visited includes
            State: Ok
            Returns: estate

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EditVisitFile
        Params: dir, rel, base, estate
        Returns: estate

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Directory length decides bare or joined
            Op: Core.StrLen
            Params: dir
            Returns: dirlen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Zero length literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: zero

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Empty directory means bare relative path
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: dirlen, zero
            Returns: bareDir

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Join directory or keep bare
            Condition: bareDir

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Bare relative path
                    Op: Core.Id
                    Params: rel
                    Returns: joined

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Slash separator literal
                    Op: Core.Lit
                    Params: "/"
                    Returns: slash

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Directory plus relative path
                    Op: Core.StrConcat
                    Params: dir, slash, rel
                    Returns: joined

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Normalize dots out of the path
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditNormalize, joined
            Returns: full

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Visited files live in the estate
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: estate, "seen"
            Returns: seen

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Already visited file
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EditHasStr, seen, full
            Returns: known

        Branch
            Type: Branch
            Role: Content
            Caption: Revisit never, adopt once
            Condition: known

            TrueBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Estate unchanged on revisit
                    Op: Core.Id
                    Params: estate
                    Returns: estate

            FalseBlock
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Remember the visited file
                    Op: Core.ListPush
                    Params: seen, full
                    Returns: seen

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Store the visited files back
                    Op: Core.MapSetMut
                    Params: estate, "seen", seen
                    Returns: estate

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the included file
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EditReadText, base, full
                    Returns: text

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Parse the included document
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: Parse, text
                    Returns: ast

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Module block of the included document
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EditFindModule, ast
                    Returns: mod

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Module children carry functions
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: mod, "children"
                    Returns: kids

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Adopt new functions first
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EditAddFuncs, estate, kids
                    Returns: estate

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Property map of the included module
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: mod, "props"
                    Returns: mprops

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Capability csv of the included module
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: mprops, "Capabilities"
                    Returns: mcsv

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Adopted capabilities live in the estate
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: estate, "caps"
                    Returns: ecaps

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Union the included capabilities
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EditCapsAdd, ecaps, mcsv
                    Returns: ucaps

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Store the capabilities back
                    Op: Core.MapSetMut
                    Params: estate, "caps", ucaps
                    Returns: estate

