            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Top-level depth is one
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 1
            Returns: one

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while functions remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: fi, flen
            Returns: fcont

        Loop
            Type: Loop
            Role: Content
            Caption: Serialize each glued function
            Condition: fcont

            Body
                Type: Section
                Role: Content

                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Caption: Read the current function
                    Op: Core.ListGet
                    Params: efuncs, fi
                    Returns: fn

