        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Property map of the arm
            Op: Core.Map
            Returns: tprops

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Store the arm type
            Op: Core.MapSet
            Params: tprops, typeKey, branchType
            Returns: tprops

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Section type literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: "Section"
            Returns: secType

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Arm type stays section
            Op: Core.MapSet
            Params: tprops, typeKey, secType
            Returns: tprops

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Store the arm role
            Op: Core.MapSet
            Params: tprops, roleKey, contentRole
            Returns: tprops

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Arm node carries the range
            Op: Core.Map
            Returns: arm

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Name key literal
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: "name"
