            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Empty frags for the clearing splice
            Op: Core.List
            Returns: nofrags

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Clear cursor starts at zero
            Op: Core.Lit
            Params: 0
            Returns: ci

        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Caption: Enter while range items remain
            Op: Core.Lt
            Params: ci, rangelen2
